# Google OAuth client credentials. The canonical copy lives in the mymacros
# Doppler project; these are the console's download and a tidied copy of it,
# kept for reference only. The pattern is deliberately broad: Google names
# its download after the client id, and that file must never be committed.
google-oauth-client.json
client_secret_*.json

# Agent worktrees and local session state — never part of the project.
.claude/

# Session plan files — working notes, not project state.
plans/

# Disposable human-review checklist written at the end of an unattended
# session (Session R onward). Read it, act on it, delete it — it is a
# handover note, not a record, and the commits are the record.
REVIEW.md

# doc-shots Chrome profile
.doc-shots-profile/
